  "feedbacks": [],
  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 5 actions (src/actions.js, getActions() returns one object). The module registers no feedbacks and no variables; src/presets.js defines presets (categories Basics and Display, 6 buttons) which are not catalogued.",
    "Protocol: binary packets (header 0x55 0xAA, JSON body, checksum) over TCP to the configured host, port 5400 when no port is set (src/main.js:200-205); the module also opens a UDP socket to port 3800 (initUDP, src/main.js:248-255). The host config field is not recorded.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.4.3 (1.x): options do not support expressions.",
    "The option labels of the dropdowns are written as 'name: ...' in the source (not a valid option field), so the options carry no label.",
    "change_black and change_freeze send the id looked up in instance.model.black/freeze (CONFIG_MODEL d12 only); string ids '0' and '1'. load_preset uses number ids 1-128 but string default '0' (recorded as written).",
    "Nothing in this file was tested against a device."
  ]
